    "detailed_description": "Just another day at the farm, face seemingly endless swarms of killer chickens.<br>They will keep coming, you can't hide.<br>Survive for as long as you can...<br><br>Your Dave, for no other reason than... 'Dave'.<br>Defend yourself from the rising army of deadly, killer chickens.<br>No one knows why they have started this - Maybe they witnessed the tasty... uh tragic, definitely tragic, death of their brothers?<br>Who knows?<br>So take what life is giving you and make chicken pies - at least the chickens are free.<br><br>Enjoy this endless first-person chicken massacre.<br>Can you top the leaderboards?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Chickens will occasionally lay eggs which will spawn baby chickens at the start of the next wave.<br></li><li> Chickens can drop chicken drumsticks - Pick them up to regain some health and show them who they are dealing with.<br></li><li> Chickens at less than 50% health will lose their head - You can *boop* them too if you'd like<br></li><li> Headless chickens will lose health over time</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Leaderboards<br></li><li> Stats<br></li><li> Achievements<br></li><li> Endless<br></li><li> Discord Integration</li></ul>",
